Error [E0112]: Service worker handler lifetime is outside the checked builder shape
  --> tests/ui/service_worker_checked_handler.jet:10:32
    |
 10 |     _ :: tree.worker("worker", callback, capacity: 1) ?? return
    |                                ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Service topology values must stay visible to sema before runtime construction
 Fix: Pass a top-level function, not a local or captured function value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
